# Pure SaaS Cursor Rules
# Universal UI/UX Design System & Anti-Slop Enforcement

When creating or modifying frontend interfaces:
1. Adhere strictly to the project's DESIGN.md tokens for color, typography, spacing, and radii.
2. Eliminate generic AI design patterns: no unapproved purple/cyan gradient text, no glassmorphism abuse, no repetitive 3-column cards.
3. Every interactive control must define hover, focus-visible (min 2px solid ring, min 3:1 contrast), and pressed states.
4. Target WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility standards.
5. In existing applications, preserve backend APIs, authentication, and database schemas.
6. Validate design documents with: node scripts/pure-saas.mjs validate DESIGN.md
